#, fuzzy
msgid "Update"
msgstr "更新"

#, fuzzy
msgid "We're pleased to announce the release of Quarkus 3.38."
msgstr "我们很高兴地宣布 Quarkus 3.38 正式发布。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As most of the development effort for new features and major upgrades is now focused on Quarkus 4, this release is lighter on features than usual.\n"
"It still comes with the following notable features:"
msgstr "由于新功能和重大升级的大部分开发工作目前都集中在 Quarkus 4 上，因此本次发布的功能相比往常有所精简。不过，它仍然包含以下值得关注的功能："

#, fuzzy
msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/55284[#55284] - Support weight-based eviction for Hibernate 2LC Caffeine cache regions"
msgstr "link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/55284[#55284] - 支持 Hibernate 2LC Caffeine 缓存区域基于权重的淘汰机制"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus HTTP Problem added to the Platform"
msgstr "Quarkus HTTP 问题已添加到平台中"

#, fuzzy
msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.38, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr "若要升级到 Quarkus 3.38，建议先将 Quarkus CLI 更新至最新版本，然后运行以下命令："

#, fuzzy
msgid "Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.38."
msgstr "请注意，` `quarkus update` ` 命令可以将您的应用程序从任何版本的 Quarkus（包括 2.x）更新至 Quarkus 3.38。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For more information about the adjustments you need to make to your applications, please refer to the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.38[Quarkus 3.38 migration guide]."
msgstr "有关您需要对应用程序进行的调整的更多信息，请参阅《 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.38[Quarkus 3.38 迁移指南] 》。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr "有什么新内容？"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Weight-based eviction for Hibernate second level Caffeine cache regions"
msgstr "基于权重的 Hibernate 二级 Caffeine 缓存区域驱逐机制"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus 3.38 introduces support for weight-based (memory) eviction for Hibernate second level cache Caffeine cache regions."
msgstr "Quarkus 3.38 引入了对 Hibernate 二级缓存（Caffeine）缓存区域基于权重（内存）的驱逐机制的支持。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Previously, only count-based eviction was available, meaning you could only configure the maximum number of entries per cache region.\n"
"With weight-based eviction, you can now configure eviction based on the estimated memory footprint of cached entities, providing more precise control over cache memory usage."
msgstr "此前，仅支持基于计数的淘汰机制，这意味着您只能配置每个缓存区域的最大条目数。借助基于权重的淘汰机制，您现在可以根据缓存实体的预估内存占用量来配置淘汰规则，从而更精确地控制缓存内存的使用情况。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus Platform"
msgstr "夸克平台"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus HTTP Problem"
msgstr "Quarkus HTTP 问题"

#, fuzzy
msgid "https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-http-problem[Quarkus HTTP Problem] has been added to the Quarkus Platform."
msgstr "link:https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-http-problem[Quarkus HTTP 问题] 已添加到 Quarkus 平台中。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This extension implements the https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9457[RFC 9457] (Problem Details for HTTP APIs) standard, automatically mapping exceptions to standardized `application/problem+json` HTTP responses."
msgstr "该扩展实现了 link:https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9457[RFC 9457] （HTTP API 问题详情）标准，可自动将异常映射到标准化的 `application/problem+json` HTTP 响应中。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It provides built-in exception mappers for common exceptions, prevents leaking stack traces and implementation details, and integrates with OpenAPI for auto-generated error documentation."
msgstr "它为常见异常提供了内置的异常映射器，可防止堆栈跟踪和实现细节泄露，并集成 OpenAPI 以自动生成错误文档。"

